@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@checkoutId = 06e315cc-9a65-47ea-9655-1a664d7e780f

### Start or recover checkout; stock must exist at this branch
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "checkoutId": "{{checkoutId}}",
  "branchId": 1,
  "items": [{"productId": 1, "quantity": 2}]
}

### After hosted card payment: server verifies Stripe, not the browser result flag
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/checkout/{{checkoutId}}/complete

### Expire unpaid checkout, or complete if payment already succeeded
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/checkout/{{checkoutId}}/cancel

### Unknown capability: 404 NOT_FOUND
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/checkout/6ce92adb-4fc6-4f27-8f72-5c91133f56f7/complete
